Subject: twinapi.appcore: Match the Language qualifier of resources.pri candidates

A resource's candidates each have a qualifier set (the [mrm_decn_info] section the resource map names). The
candidate whose Language qualifier best matches the user's UI languages is used: an exact match first, then the
same language with another region or script, then the package's default language (its fallback score), then a
candidate with no language qualifier. Other qualifiers are still not looked at. Before this the first candidate
was used, which for Xbox Accessories was Traditional Chinese.

diff --git a/dlls/twinapi.appcore/resource_manager.c b/dlls/twinapi.appcore/resource_manager.c
index 9629708..10a4868 100644
--- a/dlls/twinapi.appcore/resource_manager.c
+++ b/dlls/twinapi.appcore/resource_manager.c
@@ -1,9 +1,11 @@
